WHY IT IS NOT MIT
  The project is intended to earn revenue. A permissive licence would allow
  anyone to take it wholesale, rebrand it and run it commercially, which is
  not the intention. Publishing the source without granting those rights keeps
  the code readable and reviewable - which is the point, especially for a tool
  that handles people's data - while leaving the work itself protected.

THE PUBLIC HOLIDAY DATA
  The holiday dates under assets/holidays/ and the pages generated from them
  are compiled from publicly available sources. Factual dates are not subject
  to copyright. The compilation, the wording around it and the code that
  produces those pages are covered by this notice.

